n\n```\n|185 col 16 error| Gratuitous parentheses around expression. \n(no-extra-parens) [javascript/eslint]\n```\n\nSo the obvious work around would be to disable the rule completely, but I believe this inconsistency should be handled by the plugin.\n\nThis just started happening when I last updated \n\n```\neslint@1.3.1\nbabel-eslint@4.1.1\neslint-plugin-react@3.3.1\n```\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsx-eslint/eslint-plugin-react/issues/204/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsx-eslint/eslint-plugin-react/issues/204/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":1461439292,"node_id":"MDExOkxvY2tlZEV2ZW50MTQ2MTQzOTI5Mg==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/events/1461439292","actor":{"login":"eslint-deprecated[bot]","id":29966797,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90Mjk5NjY3OTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/3565?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eslint-deprecated%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/eslint-deprecated","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eslint-deprecated%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eslint-deprecated%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eslint-deprecated%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eslint-deprecated%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eslint-deprecated%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eslint-deprecated%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eslint-deprecated%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eslint-deprecated%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eslint-deprecated%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"B